  "title": {
    "rendered": "Asia-Pacific USAR Team Coordination Course in the Republic of Korea, 23-27 March 2026"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"17653\" class=\"elementor elementor-17653\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-360da1ed e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"360da1ed\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1a145c1d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1a145c1d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>From 23 to 27 March 2026, the National Fire Agency (NFA) of the Republic of Korea, in collaboration with the Korea Disaster Relief Team (KDRT), hosted the Urban Search and Rescue Coordination Cell (UCC) Course in Busan, Republic of Korea.</p>\n<p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --></p>\n<p>The course brought together 22 participants from eight international Urban Search and Rescue (USAR) teams, engaged in practical exercises and knowledge exchange, contributing to a more cohesive and capable global USAR network. The training reinforced regional cooperation and advanced a shared commitment to effective, coordinated disaster response. Delivered under the guidance of expert instructors from the International Search and Rescue Advisory Group (INSARAG), the training focused on strengthening coordination capacities in line with INSARAG methodology, promoting interoperability, and enhancing readiness for complex emergency operations.</p>\n<p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --></p>\n<p>The successful completion of the course by all participants reflects the continued dedication of USAR teams to uphold INSARAG standards and further improve collective response capabilities. This training course underscores the importance of international collaboration in ensuring timely, efficient, and life-saving assistance in disaster-affected areas.</p>\n<p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --></p>\n<p>Appreciation is extended to the NFA and the KDRT for hosting the course, and to the expert instructors from Australia, Singapore, and the Republic of Korea for their invaluable contributions.</p>\n<p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:image {\"id\":17658,\"width\":\"448px\",\"height\":\"auto\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --></p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1379\" height=\"919\" class=\"wp-image-17658\" style=\"width: 448px; height: auto;\" src=\"https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2-1024x682.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2-300x200.jpg 300w, https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2-768x512.jpg 768w, https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2-1200x800.jpg 1200w, https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2.jpg 1379w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1379px) 100vw, 1379px\" />     <img decoding=\"async\" width=\"445\" height=\"297\" class=\"wp-image-17655\" style=\"width: 445px;\" src=\"https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/1-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/1-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/1-300x200.jpg 300w, https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/1-768x512.jpg 768w, https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/1-1200x800.jpg 1200w, https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/1.jpg 1378w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 445px) 100vw, 445px\" /></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"></figure>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-17679\" src=\"https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Untitled-300x200.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"455\" height=\"303\" srcset=\"https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Untitled-300x200.png 300w, https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Untitled-768x512.png 768w, https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Untitled.png 1024w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 455px) 100vw, 455px\" /> <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-17688\" src=\"https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Untitled-1-300x215.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"451\" height=\"323\" srcset=\"https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Untitled-1-300x215.png 300w, https://insarag.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Untitled-1.png 639w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 451px) 100vw, 451px\" /></p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"></figure>\n<p><!-- /wp:image --></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t",
